    <footer class="border-t border-border-hairline bg-bg-canvas py-12 text-text-secondary text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-8">
          <div class="max-w-md space-y-2">
            <span class="text-text-primary font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">MONITOR / HUB</span>
            <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-[11px] font-sans">
              Client-side engineering utility for evaluating, calibrating, and benchmarking computer displays and mobile touch digitizers. Built in compliance with ISO 9241-307, VESA DisplayHDR, IEC, and CIE colorimetry standards.
